CsvRowMapper <|.. VanAvailabilityCsvMapper
TechnicianRanking <|.. WorkloadRanking
TechnicianRanking <|.. ActivationRanking
NotificationChannel <|.. EmailChannel
NotificationChannel <|.. SmsChannel

