CrewFormingService ..> WeeklyRoster
CrewFormingService ..> LeaveRecord
CrewFormingService ..> VanAvailability
CrewFormingService ..> StandbyPreference
StandbyActivationService ..> Standby
RosterController ..> RuleValidator
RosterController ..> WeeklyRoster
RosterController ..> NotificationService
